 1259:    // 
 1260:    // Where L is the level at which the field is to be interpolated. The field can be either
 1261:    // a double (depth), an array (u[nvrt]), or a function that depends on the level (Node::compZCoord(int k)). 
 1262:    // There are different versions of getNodalValues for each of these cases.
